-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §114 הפרשי שכר: a non-academic first deputy
-- of §104(א) whose degree date is within 4 years of the reform in his
-- school is owed arrears — the full-Y pay and supplement less what he was
-- paid, on the table "as in section 80"; and for a promotion "under section
-- 57".

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-59`
§ `114 הפרשי שכר`

@ref akn:art_114
GIVEN `years from the reform in the school to the degree date` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `owed the arrears of section 114` `years from the reform in the school to the degree date` IF
    `years from the reform in the school to the degree date` AT MOST 4

-- (א): F-ofek-hadash-base-114-a: the table is "כמפורט בסעיף 80", the
-- non-academic principals' tables; the first deputies' are §109's. Read
-- §109 (convention reading.misprint).
@ref akn:art_114__para_a
GIVEN `pay and supplement by the full Y` IS A NUMBER, `pay and supplement paid` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a first deputy's month of arrears for the coefficient` `pay and supplement by the full Y` `pay and supplement paid` IS
    `the month's arrears for the coefficient` `pay and supplement by the full Y` `pay and supplement paid`

-- (ב): F-ofek-hadash-base-114-b: a promotion "לפי סעיף 57", the teachers';
-- the first deputies' advance before the degree is §112. Read §112.
@ref akn:art_114__para_b
GIVEN `pay at the grade earned` IS A NUMBER, `pay at the grade paid` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a first deputy's month of arrears for the grade` `pay at the grade earned` `pay at the grade paid` IS
    `the month's arrears for the grade` `pay at the grade earned` `pay at the grade paid`

`the section 114(א) names for the table` MEANS 80
`the section 114(ב) names for the promotion` MEANS 57
`114(א) names the principals' table section` MEANS NOT (`the section 114(א) names for the table` EQUALS 109)
`114(ב) names the teachers' promotion section` MEANS NOT (`the section 114(ב) names for the promotion` EQUALS 112)
#ASSERT `114(א) names the principals' table section`
#ASSERT `114(ב) names the teachers' promotion section`
